  "np2-ignition": {
    "preset_name": "Ignition",
    "description": "Same idea as a full spectrum sweep -- 33 unique, non-repeating bands from 20Hz-18kHz in physical order -- but every zone also carries its OWN loudness floor, rising as you move from the camera arcs toward the battery bar. In a quiet intro, only the first few (lowest floor) zones flicker. As the track's overall energy climbs, more and more independently-tuned zones cross their personal threshold and stay lit, so the whole interface visibly catches fire piece by piece -- and at a full-energy drop, all 33 unique frequencies are burning at once.  MADE BY @IJS",
